Mesa's MIT licence, accompanying kumo_paint.v10.bin

kumo_paint.v10.bin is the output of Mesa 26.2.5's panfrost compiler (mesa_clc, then
panfrost_compile for arch 10) run on KUMO's kumo_paint.cl, and was compiled against Mesa's
libcl headers. Mesa distributes that compiler under the MIT licence (Mesa's licenses/MIT and
docs/license.rst). This notice travels with the binary in case any part of it derives from
Mesa. kumo_paint.cl and tools/manifest.c are KUMO's own and carry KUMO's licence
(MIT OR Apache-2.0). No Mesa source is vendored (PLAN/013 decision 2, option A).

The copyright lines below are those of the compiler sources that produce the binary
(src/panfrost/clc/pan_compile.c, src/panfrost/compiler/bifrost/bifrost_compile.c); the licence
text is Mesa's licenses/MIT, verbatim.

